  "bodyHash": "73a6a5e460a88115",
  "content": "\n\n<!--suppress HtmlDeprecatedAttribute -->\n\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"Translate via Crowdin\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\n《沉浸盔甲》為遊戲增添了許多與原版相容且獨特的盔甲套裝。與枯燥的複製貼上式盔甲不同，《沉浸盔甲》著重於視覺效果更佳的盔甲，部分還附有披風或自訂模型。多數盔甲都提供獨家特效，例如狂戰士模式、反彈傷害、尖刺、神聖護盾等。合成配方已正確登記於原版的合成書中。附魔、修理與染色功能皆能正常運作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>超過 40 種全新盔甲物品，持續更新中！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_armors%3Aarmor&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"Generated Atlas Image\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>木製盔甲</h1>\n<p>我不敢說你怎麼想，但我已經受夠被骷髁偷襲了。這套原始卻實用的盔甲能提供相當不錯的箭矢與爆炸防護。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髁盔甲</h1>\n<p>有沒有想過把敵人變成盔甲？可能沒有，但這是一套輕量級的骷髁盔甲。讓你行動更敏捷，甚至連凋零盔甲的效果也有。骷髁將不再攻擊你。</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神聖盔甲</h1>\n<p>想要引人注目嗎？來吧，這是一套華麗的黃金紅配色盔甲。你可以隨心所欲地為布料上色。除了外觀漂亮和提供極高的防護力外，穿戴全套神聖盔甲還能每分鐘完全格擋一次攻擊！</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型盔甲</h1>\n<p>高防禦、增加韌性，幾乎免疫擊退，代價是降低機動性。這套盔甲專為碾碎最強大的敵人而設計。</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史萊姆盔甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道這看起來不像盔甲。但相信我，它真的有用。攻擊你的敵人會被彈飛，爆炸造成的傷害也會大幅降低！不過穿上後你可能會有點臭……</p>\n<img width=\"300\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>戰士盔甲</h1>\n<p>這不只是維京盔甲，穿上它，你就是真正的維京人！每損失一點生命值，斧頭傷害與總體傷害就會更高。進入狂戰士模式，在殘酷的近戰中屠戮你的敵人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>長袍盔甲</h1>\n<p>蓬鬆且可染色的羊毛盔甲。內嵌烈焰棒，對所有試圖攻擊你的人造成火焰傷害！對了，它還防火。因為烈焰棒。科學！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸汽龐克盔甲</h1>\n<p>旋轉的齒輪、黃銅、羅盤、時鐘，以及大量的煙霧。讓我為你介紹最複雜的盔甲套裝——蒸汽龐克盔甲。頭盔搭載敵意雷達系統，潛行時啟動。胸甲提供增強型介面，讓你再也不必擔心時間流逝！褲腿配備雙段跳功能，靴子則因內建蒸汽噴射器而完全免疫摔落傷害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海晶盔甲</h1>\n<p>善用守衛者的尖刺來取得優勢！這套尖刺盔甲會對攻擊者造成……呃，尖刺傷害。雖然堅固的石塊會減緩你的速度，但它同時也會提供深海探索者效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>影片評測！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size: 16px; text-align: center;font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\"\nheight=\"480\" width=\"872\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何合成？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品均已整合至原版合成書（以及 JEI 等模組）。需要骨頭、鐵塊、海晶碎片、羊毛、史萊姆球、活塞、皮革盔甲、長袍、凋靈骷髁頭與木板來解鎖配方。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_armors%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"Generated Recipes Image\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>翻譯支援</h1>\n<p>\n《沉浸盔甲》目前透過機器翻譯支援多種語言，但品質往往不佳。歡迎你透過\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a>\n加入翻譯團隊。\n<br/>\n歡迎對劣質翻譯投下反對票，並提交你自己的譯文。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不相容項目</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模組（盔甲將使用醜陋的預設模型）</p>\n<p>嘗試以降低透明度方式渲染盔甲的模組</p>\n\n<h1>整合支援</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hostile-humans\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile%20Humans&description=Adds%20Hostile%20Humans%20with%20structures%20into%20your%20world&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Hostile Humans\"/>\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=A%20lot%20of%20unique%20and%20vanilla-faithful%20armor%20sets.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Armors\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20aircraft%20to%20travel%2C%20transport%2C%20and%20explore%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Aircraft\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=Play%20custom%20melodies%20on%20various%20instruments%20and%20annoy%20your%20friends%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Melodies\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=Drag%20and%20drop%2C%20pixelate%20and%20hang%20up%20beautiful%20art.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Paintings\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=A%20lightweight%20entity-tick-scheduler%20for%20doubling%20your%20TPS.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Optimization\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides%20the%20ugly%20block%20selection%20outline%20when%20not%20relevant.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=A%20set%20of%20additional%20aircraft%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20with%20Create%20support%20in%20mind.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Man of Many Planes\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20machinery%20to%20transport%2C%20mine%2C%20and%20automate%20things.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Machinery\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=Create%20custom%20and%20fancy%20furniture%20in-game%20or%20choose%20from%20a%20vast%20online%20library.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Furniture\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=Mysterious%2C%20long-forgotten%20portals%20scattered%20across%20the%20Overworld.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Gateways\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜歡這個顏色？部分盔甲套裝是可染色的！</p>\n<img width=\"700\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\"\nalt=\"Screenshot\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\">\n截圖使用的着色器為 Nostalgia Shader\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=1c6d81e57aac0f3dfbd4c31c7e6b7ae7\" alt=\"The page hash for easier page deployment.\"/>",
